{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id390747026"}, "name":{"label":"Swbym"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-08-31T05:30:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.12"}, "id":{"label":"7755094957"}, "title":{"label":"Only app that gets the job done"}, "content":{"label":"I rarely do app reviews - might even be my first one here . :) I’ve been using brain.fm for many years now. I was one of the early testers and purchased a lifetime membership which I believe doesn’t even exist anymore. And the app has evolved into a trusted friend for focus and relaxation over the years. I do frequent 15 minute power naps nearly every day with the help of the app as well as regular meditations (I prefer the unguided option) and when it comes to focus - brain.fm is the only app that gets the job done for me. And I have tried many apps over the years. Thanks for this helpful solution.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1110684238&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id686941674"}, "name":{"label":"Yogini1001"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-02-01T10:49:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"6941478232"}, "title":{"label":"Super App & super Kundenservice!!!"}, "content":{"label":"Ich nutze brain.fm seit drei Jahren vor allem die Meditations- und Schlaffunktionen. Mir helfen sie sehr, das „Drum-Herum“ auszublenden. Bei Problemen mit App unterstützt der Kundenservice sehr kompetent und geduldig! \nRundherum sehr, sehr empfehlenswert!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1110684238&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
