{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id46795241"}, "name":{"label":"Markus-.-"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-09-22T07:48:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.9"}, "id":{"label":"4823849468"}, "title":{"label":"Good effect, poor app"}, "content":{"label":"I feel a positive impact on my concentration when using the app at work. If it came with a smart and stable app, I would definitely use it more often.\n\nThe app itself I find weak. While targeting people at work, the app forces you to run portrait mode (all keyboards run in landscape). Sounds like a minor defect, to me it becomes a significant annoyance.\n\nDownload does not properly work, I have downloaded many tracks previously - however, anytime I am on a plane and want to use it, nothing is available or the app claims it had to reformat etc.\n\nI will likely cancel my subscription as I do not use it enough - also because I don’t like the app itself much.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1110684238&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
